Question:

    A
   ABA
  ABCBA
 ABCDCBA
ABCDEDCBA

Solution:

n = 5

for i in range(n):
    # spaces
    print(" " * (n - i - 1), end="")

    # increasing alphabets
    for j in range(i + 1):
        print(chr(65 + j), end="")

    # decreasing alphabets
    for j in range(i - 1, -1, -1):
        print(chr(65 + j), end="")

    print()
